  "body": "Say goodbye to renting and hello to homeownership! Be the very first to call 28 Mita Road home. Designed for easy, modern living, this brand-new residence gives you maximum space with minimal maintenance, leaving you with more free time to enjoy your weekends.\r\n\r\nWhether you are stepping onto the property ladder, starting a family, or looking for room to grow with flatmates to help pay the mortgage, this stunning home checks every box.\r\n\r\nWhy You'll Fall in Love with 28 Mita Road:\r\n\r\n* Commuter's Paradise: Walk or take a quick hop to the Silverdale Park & Ride for an effortless bus commute into the CBD!\r\n* Brand New & Move-In Ready: Enjoy pristine, quality finishes throughout. Just unlock the door, unpack, and start living.\r\n* Freehold Peace of Mind: Enjoy 214sqm of standalone freehold land-your own property, with zero body corporate fees.\r\n* Flexible, Generous Layout: Spanning approx. 173sqm across two levels, featuring:\r\n* 4 Spacious Bedrooms: Perfect for family, working from home, or renting out extra rooms to boost your income.\r\n* 2.5 Modern Bathrooms: Includes a sleek master ensuite plus a convenient ground-floor guest toilet.\r\n* 2 Living Areas: Dual spaces give you options for a media room, home office, or quiet lounge.\r\n* Sun-Drenched Entertaining: A large private deck flows seamlessly from the living area, ideal for weekend barbecues.\r\n\r\nLocation, Convenience & Lifestyle: Nestled in the heart of Silverdale, you're just minutes away from Silverdale Centre, local cafes, top-rated schools, parks, and fast motorway access.\r\n\r\nStop renting and secure your future today! Contact us now to arrange a private viewing or visit our next open home.",
